      "title": "Guide \u2014 Ziggart 3D Generation Suite (Idol Gaussian Splat, Gaussian->Mesh, SPAR3D & Hunyuan3D-2mini for RTX 3070 Ti)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKFLOW 10 : ZIGGART 3D GENERATION SUITE (RTX 3070 Ti 8GB-16GB VRAM READY)\n1. PATH A (Idol -> Gaussian Splat -> Mesh + Turntable) : ZiggartIdolImageToGaussian generates a .ply 3D Gaussian Splat (~7.2GB VRAM), ZiggartGaussianToMesh converts it into a .glb/.obj mesh, and Ziggart3DTurntableRenderer renders 360-degree turntable frames.\n2. PATH B (SPAR3D Fast Textured Mesh) : ZiggartSPAR3DImageToMesh runs with low_vram_mode=True (~7.0GB VRAM) to produce a UV-unwrapped textured .glb mesh in ~1-2s.\n3. PATH C (Hunyuan3D-2mini High-Sharpness Mesh) : ZiggartHunyuan3DImageToMesh runs the 0.6B shape model (~5.5GB VRAM) and unloads it before running optional PBR texture painting."
      ],
      "color": "#234",
      "bgcolor": "#356"
    },
